.TH FT891REMOTE 1 "September 2026" "FT891Remote" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
ft891remote \- remote front panel for a Yaesu FT\-891
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B ft891remote
.SH DESCRIPTION
Connects to an
.BR ft891remote\-server (1)
and operates the radio from wherever the operator is: two\-way audio, PTT,
frequency and mode, the front\-panel keys and levels, the FUNCTION, CW and FM
settings, the keyer memories and the whole MENU.
.PP
The frequency display is a tuning surface: the mouse wheel tunes by the current
step (Shift for ten steps), a horizontal drag does the same on a touch screen,
and a click opens direct entry. The space bar is push\-to\-talk when no text
field has the focus.
.PP
An optional rigctld\-compatible port on 127.0.0.1:4532 lets WSJT\-X, fldigi or
JS8Call drive the remote radio: frequency, mode, split and PTT.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I ~/.config/FT891Remote/FT891RemoteClient.conf
Settings: station address, password, audio devices, codec, tuning step, CW
macros.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR ft891remote\-server (1)
